# Multi-Agent BRD to Engineering (BRD-to-Engg) Pipeline

An end-to-end multi-agent orchestration framework designed to ingest, decompose, and transform unstructured **Business Requirements Documents (BRDs)** and Product Requirement Documents (PRDs) into comprehensive, production-ready **Engineering Specifications**, architecture blueprints, API contracts, and delivery tasks.

---

## 📌 Overview

Translating high-level business requirements into technical execution plans typically requires days of cross-functional alignment. This system utilizes specialized collaborative AI agents to automate the pipeline:

1. **Ingests** business problem statements and functional requirements.
2. **Grounds** decisions against architectural standards and enterprise knowledge bases.
3. **Decomposes** scope into system architecture, data models, and API interfaces.
4. **Produces** actionable sprint backlogs (Epics, User Stories, Acceptance Criteria) and technical documentation.

---

## 📂 Repository Structure

```text
MULTI_AGENT_BRD_TO_ENGG/
│
├── Inputs/                 # Raw input BRDs, PRDs, RFPs, and business briefs (DOCX, PDF, MD)
├── Knowledge Base/         # Architecture patterns, domain guidelines, tech-stack standards, and SOPs
├── Solution Building/      # Multi-agent orchestrators, agent role definitions, prompts, and workflows
├── JasonFiles/             # Structured intermediary data, entity schemas, JSON payloads, and API specs
└── Output/                 # Final deliverables: Architecture Design Documents, Epics/Stories, and Test Plans
